## What it does

See exactly where your AI agents spend money

CostLens attributes LLM and agent inference cost to the agent, feature, and user that triggered it - with a running ledger, per-agent budget guardrails, and early-warning alerts before a loop drains the budget.

## Capabilities

- Cost by agent / feature / user
- Budget guardrails
- Early-warning alerts
- Audit-ready ledger

